{"version":1,"key":"card:102","content":{"id":102,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果希望显示有关文件更多的信息，例如文件权限，文件大小等等，我们可以添加 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"-l","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 选项显示更多信息"}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"# 显示文件的详细信息\n~ » ls -l\ntotal 32\n-rwxr-xr-x 1 xt xt 16696 Nov  9 16:10 hello\n-rw-r--r-- 1 xt xt   168 Nov  9 15:51 hello.c\ndrwxr-xr-x 1 xt xt  4096 Nov  9 16:09 math","language":"bash","uuid":"0529a82f-d0f7-4d1e-917c-17c7f2c36207","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"所显示文件信息依次为："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件类型，比如目录(d)、文件(-)、链接文件(l)、字符型文件(c)、块设备(b)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件权限(rwxr-xr-x)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件硬链接总数(1)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件归属者的用户名(xt)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件归属组的组名(xt)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件大小(16696，以字节为单位)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件的上次修改时间(16:10)"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"文件名或目录名(hello)"}]}]}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"info","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"-l","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"l","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 表示的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"long","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的意思。"}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/命令/ls"],"createTime":1689176755021,"updateTime":1745155258270,"linkedCards":[{"id":99,"target":{"key":"card:99","type":"card","id":99},"summary":"ls 命令的作用是查看指定目录下包含的所有文件及目录。 # 查看当前目录包含的文件及目录 ~ » ls hello hello.c math 当前目录包含两个文件 hello hello.c 和一个目录 math 。 上述 ls 命令没有指...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]},{"id":103,"target":{"key":"card:103","type":"card","id":103},"summary":"有关文件大小那一列，我们发现它是以字节为单位，我们可能很难马上反应过来有多大，我们可以添加 -h 选项，以更加人性化的方式显示文件的大小 # 选项没有先后顺序，-h -l 也是可以的 ~ » ls -l -h total 32K -rwxr...","tags":["Linux/命令/ls"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745155258270}}